{"scenarioId":"12_Revenge","scenarioName":"Revenge","story":[{"attrs":{},"children":[{"tag":"part","config":{"attrs":{"story":"The mission had been more difficult than Kai Krellis would have believed when he started. Finally though, the end was in sight. He had seen how priestesses could carve through masses of undead, and now he traveled with a whole contingent of them. Tyegëa was even more powerful, though as unpredictable as Cylanna had said."},"children":[{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/background.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_ratio":true},"children":[]}},{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/dw.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_ratio":true,"base_layer":true},"children":[]}}]}},{"tag":"part","config":{"attrs":{"story":"The tribe that had fled Jotha unable to fight returned as an army stiffened by veteran fighters and led by a warrior king. Though they were tired from their journey, weariness fell from them as they neared home. The merfolk arrived during the night, and found the mouth of their bay guarded, so they headed south along the coast to some outlying villages to gather news of the invaders."},"children":[{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/background.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_ratio":true},"children":[]}},{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/dw.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_ratio":true,"base_layer":true},"children":[]}}]}}]},{"attrs":{},"children":[{"tag":"part","config":{"attrs":{"show_title":true},"children":[{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/background.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_ratio":true},"children":[]}},{"tag":"background_layer","config":{"attrs":{"image":"maps/dw.webp","scale_vertically":true,"scale_horizontally":false,"keep_aspect_